<p>President Trump said he will travel to Beijing on May 14 and 15 for a rescheduled state visit with Chinese President Xi Jinping, after a trip initially planned for next week was delayed by the ongoing Iran war. Trump and the White House said Xi is expected to make a reciprocal visit to Washington later this year.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/XX4z0cBjzPASQ5DsmbomoYMFO5CmSUO3QmPc7UXVVKZjj8rKUQVsEuujpKRVDEq9E3ede2pLkc79KwiWT7PLvG-vcY1uynu5b2GNwxlQStceYqZuafbbdw0ORVqjLFg4RRBF3irxUyaMMdEV2r11xashWTe1UPUBSW92z1whm8d_qmKD7fvhsPHjbyu7jVTAkduoYDyWz0y6v9vLOXpT3GjxXJzw2jMmE7dNGyYDvqM7EZbrM2VKE9S7WheSyPpW7p50iUW_shqHpKhoxg' alt='President Donald Trump, left, and Chinese President Xi Jinping pose ahead of their summit talk at Gimhae International Airport in Busan, South Korea, on Oct. 30, 2025.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Protocol detail: The White House said the later Washington visit would include both first couples, with President Trump and First Lady Melania Trump set to host Xi Jinping and Madame Peng.</li><li>Strategic balancing act: Dawn said the rescheduling underscores Trump’s effort to project confidence during a difficult Middle East war while also managing a tense relationship with China.</li><li>War timing question: Asked whether the conflict would be over by the May summit, Karoline Leavitt said the administration had estimated it would last about four to six weeks.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>White House: Karoline Leavitt said Xi understood the need to reschedule the trip after the Iran-war delay. (<a href='https://michaelwest.com.au/trump-to-meet-xi-in-china-in-may-white-house-says/'>Michael West</a>)</li><li>President Trump: Trump said the two meetings would be &#x27;Historic Visits&#x27; and said he looked forward to spending time with Xi in what he called a &#x27;Monumental Event&#x27;. (<a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/trump-reschedules-iran-delayed-china-visit-may-14-15'>Al-Monitor</a>)</li><li>China&#x27;s embassy in Washington: The embassy said it had no information to provide on the White House announcement, reflecting Beijing’s usual practice of disclosing Xi’s schedule only a few days in advance. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1985501/trump-plans-may-visit-to-china-for-talks-with-xi-after-iran-war-delay'>Dawn</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3347914/xi-trump-summit-white-house-locks-new-dates-may'>Xi-Trump summit: White House locks in new dates in May, Beijing silent</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1985501/trump-plans-may-visit-to-china-for-talks-with-xi-after-iran-war-delay'>Trump plans May visit to China for talks with Xi after Iran war delay</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://michaelwest.com.au/trump-to-meet-xi-in-china-in-may-white-house-says/'>Trump to meet Xi in China in May, White House says</a> - michaelwest.com.au</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/trump-reschedules-iran-delayed-china-visit-may-14-15'>Trump reschedules Iran-delayed China visit for May 14-15</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/mar/26/trump-xi-jinping-china-trip-rescheduled-may'>Trump’s trip to meet Xi Jinping in China rescheduled for May due to Iran war</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/trump-to-visit-china-in-may-after-rescheduling-trip-due-to-iran-war/article70786791.ece'>Trump to visit China in May after rescheduling trip due to Iran war</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/trump-to-visit-china-on-may-14-15-white-house-says'>Trump reschedules Iran-delayed China visit for May 14 and 15</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-trump-xi-china-beijing-iran-war/'>Trump’s rescheduled China trip to go ahead in May</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li></ul>